<p>Thank you for reading. Hope you enjoyed.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Author&nbsp;Comments</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Some&nbsp;thoughts...</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>I read a good bit of Sci-fi, and it seems modern Sci-fi tends to be dark, obscure, and heavily symbolic. Sometimes I miss the idea of a good, old-fashioned, space adventure. So, in many ways, writing this article was therapeutic for me.</p>
<p>Edit: Ah, almost forgot. I also wanted to give a big thanks to all those who helped out in chat and forum. Without their help, this would probably be a confusing mess. Thanks.</p>
