<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>So, I had a bit of trouble trying to find a good image that was Creative Commons legal. After a while of searching, I just decided it would be easier to take my own picture. I built the model using an artist figure, foam blocks, and metallic spray paint. I'm pretty happy with how it came out, and I think it fits the article well. Also, not sure if it's necessary, but I wanted to make sure and say that I'm officially releasing this photo under Creative Commons.</p>
</div>
